$DIR/test.p:5:4: invalid operation: cannot receive from non-channel int x (variable of type int)
    This error occurs when there is a channel receive from a value that is
    either not a channel, or is a send-only channel.
    (see "Receive operator" in the Plutonium spec, section 11.23)
    (run "pluto explain E0058" for a longer explanation)
